<title>MEXICO: Telmex offers 9.0 bln pesos paper.</title>
<headline>Telmex offers 9.0 bln pesos paper.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telephone company Telmex said in newspaper advertisements on Wednesday that it plans to issue a total 9.0 million pesos in commercial paper.</p>
<p>The paper was divided into two issues, one of 6.0 billion pesos for a term of 1,092 days and the other of 3.0 billion pesos for a term of 14 days.</p>
</text>
